## TCK

Tags: @core, @identity, @feature-flags, @otel, @parameters

Start the stack and go-srv as `.deploy/local/README.md` describes (from `go-srv/`, so relative paths resolve against `go-srv/`), with `APP_FLAGS_FILE=../specs/feature-flags/tck/fixtures/flags.yaml` in the go-srv environment only, then run from the project root:

    TCK_BASE_URL=http://localhost:10100 npm --prefix specs run tck
